---js
{
  layout: "layouts/base.njk",
  noindex: true,
  eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true,
  // One page per language: /impressum.html (English), /de/impressum.html, /sq/impressum.html.
  pagination: { data: "legalLangs", size: 1, alias: "lang" },
  legalLangs: ["en", "de", "sq"],
  eleventyComputed: {
    title: (data) => ({ en: "Legal notice", de: "Impressum", sq: "Shënim ligjor" })[data.lang],
  },
  // Only published once the name and city in src/_data/legal.json are filled in.
  permalink: (data) => (data.legal.name && data.legal.city ? (data.lang === "en" ? "/impressum.html" : `/${data.lang}/impressum.html`) : false),
}
---
{%- set email = legal.email or site.email -%}
{%- set contactUrl = "/contact.html" | local(lang) -%}
{%- if lang == "de" %}
<section class="shell page-hero legal-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Rechtliches</p>
  <h1>Impressum</h1>
</section>
<section class="shell legal">
  <h2>Anbieter</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}<br>{{ legal.country }}</p>

  <h2>Kontakt</h2>
  <p>E-Mail: <a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a>{% if legal.phone %}<br>Telefon: {{ legal.phone }}{% endif %}{% if site.contact.action %}<br>Kontaktformular: <a href="{{ contactUrl }}">Zum Kontaktformular</a>{% endif %}</p>

  <h2>Verantwortlich für den Inhalt</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}, {{ legal.country }}</p>

  <h2>Haftung für Links</h2>
  <p>Diese Website enthält Links zu externen Websites Dritter. Auf deren Inhalte habe ich keinen Einfluss; für sie ist stets der jeweilige Anbieter verantwortlich. Bei Bekanntwerden von Rechtsverletzungen werden entsprechende Links umgehend entfernt.</p>

  <h2>Urheberrecht</h2>
  <p>Die Texte, Grafiken und das Logo auf dieser Website sind urheberrechtlich geschützt. Vervielfältigung oder Verwendung außerhalb der Grenzen des Urheberrechts bedarf der vorherigen schriftlichen Zustimmung.</p>
</section>
{%- elif lang == "sq" %}
<section class="shell page-hero legal-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Ligjore</p>
  <h1>Shënim ligjor</h1>
</section>
<section class="shell legal">
  <h2>Ofruesi</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}<br>{{ legal.country | replace("Albanien", "Shqipëri") }}</p>

  <h2>Kontakti</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a>{% if legal.phone %}<br>Telefon: {{ legal.phone }}{% endif %}{% if site.contact.action %}<br>Forma e kontaktit: <a href="{{ contactUrl }}">Te forma e kontaktit</a>{% endif %}</p>

  <h2>Përgjegjës për përmbajtjen</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}, {{ legal.country | replace("Albanien", "Shqipëri") }}</p>

  <h2>Përgjegjësia për lidhjet</h2>
  <p>Kjo faqe përmban lidhje drejt faqeve të jashtme të palëve të treta. Mbi përmbajtjen e tyre nuk kam asnjë ndikim; për të përgjigjet gjithmonë ofruesi përkatës. Nëse marr dijeni për shkelje ligjore, lidhjet përkatëse hiqen menjëherë.</p>

  <h2>E drejta e autorit</h2>
  <p>Tekstet, grafikat dhe logoja në këtë faqe mbrohen nga e drejta e autorit. Riprodhimi ose përdorimi i tyre jashtë kufijve të së drejtës së autorit kërkon pëlqimin paraprak me shkrim.</p>
</section>
{%- else %}
<section class="shell page-hero legal-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
  <h1>Legal notice</h1>
</section>
<section class="shell legal">
  <h2>Provider</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}<br>{{ legal.country | replace("Albanien", "Albania") }}</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a>{% if legal.phone %}<br>Phone: {{ legal.phone }}{% endif %}{% if site.contact.action %}<br>Contact form: <a href="{{ contactUrl }}">Open the contact form</a>{% endif %}</p>

  <h2>Responsible for the content</h2>
  <p>{{ legal.name }}<br>{% if legal.street %}{{ legal.street }}<br>{% endif %}{{ legal.postcode }} {{ legal.city }}, {{ legal.country | replace("Albanien", "Albania") }}</p>

  <h2>Liability for links</h2>
  <p>This website contains links to external websites of third parties. I have no influence over their content; the respective provider is always responsible for it. Should I become aware of any infringement, the links concerned will be removed at once.</p>

  <h2>Copyright</h2>
  <p>The texts, graphics and logo on this website are protected by copyright. Reproduction or use beyond the limits of copyright law requires prior written consent.</p>
</section>
{%- endif %}
